風、韓式風、地獄風、中國風、濃郁風、海鮮風\n以及小菜（內用需自取－門口處冰箱）\n麵體分有：捲麵（需煮４分鐘）＆細麵（需煮１分半）\n麵規格：有一般碗＆加大碗(麵多一份)\n店內設有免費的飲料機與水可供飲用\n\n出餐速度頗快\n點了韓式泡菜拉麵、東京豚骨拉麵、蒙古白湯拉麵\n捲麵的麵體Ｑ彈有嚼勁、湯頭風味香醇、肉片軟嫩、糖心蛋＆海苔海菜爽口\n讓人吃得不只飽足、更是滿滿的幸福感\n\n且老闆很貼心\n只要是高中職以下的學生\n穿學生制服來店內用或外帶\n每人每碗可折扣１０元\n\n臨捷運三重站、公車站都很近\n停車：\n1.俥亭三重農會停車場(每小時$30)\n2.三陽路停車場(每小時$30)\n3.正好停-三重重陽公園地下停車場(每小時$30)\n\n如此用心經營的好店家\n真要好好推薦",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7582389272941986898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUzA5VVZrcE9NbmQwV2xSc1YxWnNaSGhWUjJ4VlZHdHNTMU5GUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3744,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGS09UVkpOMnd0WlRsV1ZsZHhVR2xVVGtsS1NFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x721222348ec094bd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFKOTVJN2wtZTlWVldxUGlUTklKSEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGS09UVkpOMnd0WlRsV1ZsZHhVR2xVVGtsS1NFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGS09UVk